You mean that picture of Caroline in her pants

348
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:13,500
然后上面写着"我烦死她了"吗
that said, "I'm so sick of her"?

349
00:16:13,580 --> 00:16:14,660
对 就是那条
I know, right?

350
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:16,600
哪天她弄到了新衣服 就直接杀了我吧
If she ever gets a new shirt, just kill me.

351
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:19,360
我懂你的意思 麦克斯 但我不敢相信
I hear you, Max, but I just can't believe

352
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:21,240
你还把这条短信发给她了
you included her on the text.

353
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:23,340
是啊 什么
Yeah. What?

354
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:27,660
天啊 我群发忘了踢她出群聊圈了
Oh, my god. I didn't take her off the chain.

355
00:16:27,980 --> 00:16:29,920
如果你要说一个孩子坏话
I mean, if you're gonna trash a child,

356
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:31,520
一定得先把她踢出圈子啊
you got to take her off the chain.

357
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,120
瞧 厄尔 新裤子来了
Look, Earl, they're here!

358
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:35,940
瞧你捐的10块钱给你什么好处
Look what your $10 is buying you!

359
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,860
不想看 不想知道
Uh-uh, not looking. Don't want to know.

360
00:16:37,960 --> 00:16:39,640
我要自己退出这圈子
I'm taking myself off the chain.

361
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,940
卡洛琳
Uh, hey, Caroline.

362
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:44,260
-你有收到我的短信吗 -还没
- Uh, did you get my text? - Not yet.

363
00:16:44,280 --> 00:16:45,911
餐馆前门的手机信号很差
The front of the diner is a bad reception area.

364
00:16:45,911 --> 00:16:47,400
别看 别看
Uh, no, no, no, no.

365
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,820
别拿手机出来了
Don't reach for that.

366
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:50,620
可能只是安珀警报
It's probably just an Amber alert.

367
00:16:52,760 --> 00:16:54,080
你干嘛怪怪的
Why are you acting weird?

368
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,200
你是不是嫉妒我有新裤子
Oh, are you jealous of my new pants?

369
00:16:57,860 --> 00:17:00,860
不是 但是我可能在短信里
No, but I may have texted something about you

370
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:01,600
乱说了你一些事
that I didn't mean,

371
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,740
所以拜托不要看你的手机
So just please don't look at your phone.

372
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:05,120
好的
Uh, okay.

373
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:07,000
如果说的是坏话 那我也不想看
If it's something bad, I don't want to see it anyway.

374
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:11,240
她一定会看的 对吧 厄尔
She's gonna look at it, isn't she, Earl?

375
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,160
是我肯定会
I would.

376
00:17:13,340 --> 00:17:14,260
她刚看了
She just did.

377
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:18,540
你烦死我了
You're so sick of me?

378
00:17:19,575 --> 00:17:21,706
闹着玩嘛
'cause it's funny!

379
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:24,260
"我烦死你了"
"I'm so sick of you"

380
00:17:25,340 --> 00:17:26,900
你懂的 就闹着玩而已
You know, said funny.

381
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,580
你了解我的嘛 不信问厄尔
You know how I am. Ask earl.

382
00:17:28,580 --> 00:17:29,120
厄尔 救我
Earl, help.

383
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,180
我已经退出圈子了
Oh, I am off the chain.

384
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:32,171
奥列格 救我
Oleg, help.

385
00:17:33,340 --> 00:17:34,300
我在车上等你
I'll be in my car.

386
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:37,340
瞧 阿憨来了
Oh, look, look! Here's Han!

387
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,300
他知道我经常开玩笑闹着玩
He knows how I'm always just joking.

388
00:17:39,300 --> 00:17:41,280
阿憨 别问原因快点头
Han, nod your head and don't ask why.

389
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:43,500
不要 上次你让我这么做
Oh, no, last time you asked me to do that,

390
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:45,140
结果我跟得了白化病的人约会
I wound up on a date with an albino.

391
00:17:47,780 --> 00:17:49,280
那后来是谁没给对方回电的
And who didn't call who back?

392
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,480
我都不知道她们哪里来的自信
I don't know how they're so confident.

393
00:17:55,040 --> 00:17:56,900
麦克斯 你说你烦我
Max, you said you were sick of me.

394
00:17:57,540 --> 00:17:59,180
你干嘛这么生气
Oh, why are you so upset?

395
00:17:59,260 --> 00:18:01,280
我经常对你说一些更难听的话
I say worse things to you all the time.

396
00:18:01,520 --> 00:18:03,460
昨天我还说你可怜又可悲
Yesterday I said you were sad and pathetic.

397
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,160
但那是当着我的面
But that was to my face.

398
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:08,080
我真不敢相信你居然在背后说我坏话
I can't believe you talk about me behind my back.

399
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:09,680
这是我不好 对不起
It's bad. I am sorry.

400
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:10,960
你要怎么惩罚我
What can I do?

401
00:18:11,220 --> 00:18:12,360
打我 揍我
Hit me. Punch me.

402
00:18:12,460 --> 00:18:13,580
还是告诉我妈我的地址
Tell my mother where I live.

403
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:15,880
恭喜你 麦克斯
Congratulations, Max.

404
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,400
现在你就像我以前的朋友
Now you're like all my old girlfriends,

405
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,000
专在背后说我坏话
talking behind my back.

406
00:18:23,940 --> 00:18:25,440
别看了 删掉它
Stop looking at that. Delete it.

407
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,640
这不是我的真实想法
This is not what I think.

408
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:28,540
-我没有烦你 -真的吗
- I'm not sick of you. - Really?

409
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,220
可我看着这几个字 就觉得你的确是烦我
'cause when I see it in writing, it feels like you are.

410
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:32,220
这不是我 是这手机在作怪
It's not me. It's this phone.

411
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:35,220
它把我本来就丑恶的那面给揭露出来了
It brought out the ugliness that was kind of already there.

412
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:38,480
你看
There!

413
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,980
因为它伤害了你 所以我毁掉它
I killed it because it hurt you.

414
00:18:41,460 --> 00:18:43,300
我发誓我不是故意的
I swear I didn't mean it.

415
00:18:43,300 --> 00:18:44,680
你一定要相信我
You have to believe me.

416
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:46,400
没关系 麦克斯
It's fine, Max.

417
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:51,280
我感觉我要吐了
I feel like I'm gonna throw up.

418
00:18:56,528 --> 00:18:59,500
瞧 我把我的手机炸了
There... I french-fried my phone.

419
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:00,540
你还想我怎么样
What else can I do?

420
00:19:00,980 --> 00:19:03,080
真的 这是科技的错
I mean, really, it is technology's fault.

421
00:19:03,120 --> 00:19:04,580
它让我们彼此翻脸
It's turning us against each other.

422
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:08,540
卡洛琳 我发誓 我再也不会意外说出
Caroline, I swear, I will never accidentally say

423
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:11,220
任何我不是真心说你的坏话
anything about you again that I never meant.

424
00:19:12,380 --> 00:19:14,000
我得开始干活了 没关系啦
I have to get ready for work. It's fine.

425
00:19:15,360 --> 00:19:16,520
别这么说
Stop saying that.

426
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:17,800
拜托不要再说"没关系"了
Please stop saying it's fine.

427
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:19,220
"没关系"就是有关系
"Fine" doesn't mean fine.

428
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:21,740
形容事情好坏的顺序是很棒 很好 还行
The scale goes great, good, okay,

429
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:23,320
不行 我讨厌你 没关系
not okay, I hate you, fine.

430
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:26,020
如果"没关系"真的是没关系 那当然是最好
If "fine" meant fine, that'd be great,

431
00:19:26,020 --> 00:19:26,940
但它不是
but it doesn't, okay?

432
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,560
你说的对 的确有关系
You're right. It's not fine.

433
00:19:28,740 --> 00:19:29,980
这太过分了 我受伤了
It sucks. I'm hurt.

434
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:31,560
你是我最在乎的人
You're the one person I care most about.

435
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:33,720
不 你才是我唯一让我最在乎的人
No, you are the one person I care the most about.

436
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:36,240
但现在感觉就不是那样
Well, right now it doesn't feel that way.

437
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,700
必须是那样
It has to feel that way!

438
00:19:37,780 --> 00:19:39,240
你是我最好的朋友 卡洛琳
You are my best friend, Caroline!

439
00:19:39,240 --> 00:19:40,580
我爱你
I love you.

440
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:53,340
天啊 现在我是真的要吐了
Oh, my god, now I'm really gonna throw up.

441
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,800
麦克斯 这是你第一次说"我爱你"吗
Max, is that the first time you said "I love you"?

442
00:19:58,240 --> 00:20:00,040
不要看人家 人家害羞啦
Don't look at me. I'm embarrassed.

443
00:20:01,620 --> 00:20:02,920
现在我们干嘛
Now what do we do?

444
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,980
所以你并不烦我吗
So you're not sick of me?

445
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:08,980
你是全世界我唯一
You are the only person in the entire world

446
00:20:08,980 --> 00:20:10,180
不会觉得烦的人
I am not sick of.

447
00:20:11,260 --> 00:20:11,660
卡洛琳
Caroline...

448
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:17,100
有个女的说花了钱要赏你巴掌
There's a woman here who said she paid to slap you.

449
00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:18,500
如果早知道可以这样
If I had known it was an option,

450
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:19,960
我也参与捐款了
I would have thrown my name into that hat.

451
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:25,240
是时候把这个戴上了
Well, time to put this on.

452
00:20:25,260 --> 00:20:26,700
那可是我价值500块的承诺啊
That's my $500 pledge.

453
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:28,460
-我去吧 -什么
- I'll go. - What?

454
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,560
我替你挨巴掌 我活该
I'll take it. I deserve it.

455
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:33,000
你已经被我扇了一耳光了
You've already gotten a slap in the face from me.

456
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:35,000
但她要见的是我
But she's expecting to see me.

457
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:37,880
错 她要见的是一个戴着纸袋的
No, she's expecting to see a clueless woman

458
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,920
白痴女人
wearing a paper bag.

459
00:20:39,120 --> 00:20:40,020
虽然我本计划是20 25年后
And even though I wasn't planning

460
00:20:40,020 --> 00:20:42,100
才打算变成这样的女人
on becoming that woman for another 20, 25 years,

461
00:20:42,140 --> 00:20:42,660
但今天算我欠你的
I owe you.

462
00:20:49,080 --> 00:20:50,380
真的吗 你不打算阻止我吗
Seriously? You're not gonna stop me?

463
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:54,140
不打算
Nope.

464
00:20:55,280 --> 00:20:56,060
对了 麦克斯
And, Max...

465
00:20:56,960 --> 00:20:58,250
我也爱你
I love you too.

466
00:20:59,580 --> 00:21:00,960
我真是烦死你了
I'm so sick of you.
